# Copy to .env.local and enter your own key in a LOCAL editor.
# Copia a .env.local y escribe tu clave en un editor LOCAL.
# Never share this key or put it in a VITE_ variable.
GEXBOT_API_KEY=

# Defaults work for a normal installation. Optional examples:
# PORT=4321
# POLL_MS=10000
# DB_PATH=data/gex-cockpit.db
# GEX_STATE_AGGREGATION=zero
# GEX_OI_AGGREGATION=full
# MOCK=1 still contacts GexBot for seed data; it is NOT an offline demo.
